# Copy to .dev.vars (git ignored) for local development.
# In production these are Cloudflare secrets set with:
#   wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
#
# None is needed for the site as it stands. All three are required only when
# the contact form's delivery endpoint is built (spec 0001, deferred in the
# scope). TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY is the server half of the contact form's
# Turnstile check (spec 0011); the public site key lives in .env instead.

# RESEND_API_KEY=""
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=""
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=""
